<title>CHINA: SGA sets call warrants on HSBC Holdings.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on HSBC Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Thursday it had launched 17 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$292.95	PREMIUM	 16.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$3.1527	GEARING	 8.85x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 17.JUL.97	PAYDATE	 05.AUG.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.MAY.98	LISTING DATE  06.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	BOARD LOT     4,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$279</p>
<p>	 -- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
